~script7363(interface_944:com_168, interface_944:com_170, interface_944:com_40, interface_944:com_1, %varplayerbit_17465, 4, "Log Splitting<br>Imparts a chance to split a log as you chop it, converting the log into additional Woodcutting experience.");
